    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Mars,Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 2–7</p><p>Police baboons are transgenic Cape baboons modified for obedience, heightened intelligence, and longer attention spans. Baboon units remain popular for tracking, crowd control, and guarding prisoners, though they have been known to turn as a pack upon their handler in stressful situations.</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Bioweave Armor (Light), Enhanced Respiration, Enhanced Vision, Neurachem (Level 1), Temperature Tolerance</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 6, Death Rating 45.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 159.</em></p>",
